            <ArticleTitle>Synchronous torsion of testicular appendages: a rare mechanical cause of bilateral scrotal pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>519-20</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe a case of synchronous torsion of testicular appendages, a previously unreported cause of bilateral scrotal pain. Exploration and excision was curative.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
